OL,5,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FThe interceptors are after a man
OL,7,     Fwanted on suspicion of making
OL,8,     Fthreats to kill, who could be
OL,9,     Farmed, and Coups and police dog
OL,10,     FRambo are on the lookout for a
OL,11,     Fsuspected shoplifter.
OL,12,G1500 Police Interceptors
OL,13,     FUnits tail a van speeding at four
OL,14,     Ftimes the limit. After the vehicle
OL,15,     Fpops a tyre, the driver tries to
OL,16,     Fflee as a three-wheeler, then on
OL,17,     Ffoot. But police dog Quantum is at
OL,18,     Fhis heels...
