OL,5,G1600 Police Interceptors
OL,6,     FA runaway car speeds through the
OL,7,     FNottinghamshire countryside, a
OL,8,     Froutine stop turns nasty, and an
OL,9,     Fartist in a rush is clocked
OL,10,     Fspeeding at over 100mph.
OL,11,G1700 Shoplifters: Caught Red Handed
OL,12,     FA man is behaving suspiciously and
OL,13,     Fmay have a weapon. Guards Mark and
OL,14,     FKeith's number-one priority is to
OL,15,     Fkeep the public safe, so they put
OL,16,     Ftheir lives on the line to corner
OL,17,     Fhim. (Ep9)
OL,18,G1800 Home and Away
OL,19,     FJohn scrambles for donations. Jo
OL,20,     Fand Lacey demand the truth. David
OL,21,     Ffaces his trauma.
