OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FDavid comes clean. Tane texts his
OL,7,     Fex. Jo misreads the situation.
OL,8,     FRemi feels like a third wheel.
OL,9,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,10,     FIn Peterborough the surgery is
OL,11,     Fvisited by patients including
OL,12,     FAnita who's suffering from dizzy
OL,13,     Fspells, Sarah who's feverish with
OL,14,     Fa racing heart, and Clare, worried
OL,15,     Fabout her finger.
OL,16,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,17,     FNursing staff have called in sick
OL,18,     Fat Barnsley Hospital and the team
OL,19,     Fis under pressure as patient
OL,20,     Fnumbers are rising. A patient in
OL,21,     Fextreme pain needs immediate
OL,22,     Ftreatment.
