OL,5,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,6,     FAn ambulance crew bring in a
OL,7,     Fpatient who acts aggressively and
OL,8,     Fis a regular at the hospital. And
OL,9,     Fa 45-year-old suffers
OL,10,     Flife-threatening anaphylaxis from
OL,11,     Fan allergic reaction.
OL,12,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FA pair of men who work at a
OL,14,     Fhazardous waste disposal business
OL,15,     Fare injured after an explosion
OL,16,     Frocks the premises; a street fight
OL,17,     Fends with two wounded.
